  - TotalScore: 0
    LevelName: P1TOK
    voiceOverDatas:
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8ce0767ec3d23204387bf6e7e3d91bbf, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6eac779f8fea88d409657797dc3a68c0, type: 3}
      subText: 'Welcome to the Immobilizer Line simulation tutorial '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 04f6362a9a34e0242a7d4b5070a2defe, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c8245a8aef1bc8a4b909e12e8378abea, type: 3}
      subText: 'Go to first stage which is manual insertion and Pick antenna sub
        assembly from tray using left hand '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6707b9faf2843f34cbc65c04dc72b103, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2f590c6084a79e048943036c841c2570, type: 3}
      subText: Now Pick circuit assembly from tray using right hand
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 538d564f5a00b574e9f1868aaa5936d4, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21b71d04bac6a4c41af2cef555411bd2, type: 3}
      subText: 'Place circuit assembly on the antenna sub assembly same as highlighted '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 099c26aae96306d4bbe120bff7ac99b4, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 87a727d6ebc8de44a850241b76e66964, type: 3}
      subText: 'Go to the manual punching machine and place the antenna sub assembly
        on the jig as highlighted '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7fa7f01184b01b24c949bc342bfbb287, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 82be4c7e6792d1245ba578116e463815, type: 3}
      subText: 'After placing antenna sub assembly on jig , now close the toggle
        clamp '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 34c8f4d3d0d9f284b9730c2fc996f065, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93891a03cce805f418055017e5c46454, type: 3}
      subText: 'Pull the lever to press the circuit assembly into the antenna sub
        assembly '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 92cdf6399c758854e83e34ad3bf953a5, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5fe6d60d8996e3f4889791f0d9575a37, type: 3}
      subText: 'Open the toggle clamp '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a0549815b223c134e822f22828b67c51, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f534557168b93234fbde177588a486ea, type: 3}
      subText: Pick antenna sub assembly from manual punching machine and go to next
        stage which is terminal robot soldering and place it on the jig as highlighted
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 34c03362fde6d614a9f18c5bb4017d29, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 94600126baeffca47aa9b7520a287204, type: 3}
      subText: 'Press green button to start soldering '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a7ca4ede950e0ed40a33ee81587b442a, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d349d6e4235d6c42b140b14eef95ff3, type: 3}
      subText: Wait for the soldering process to complete
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 811d1a3ae7053a94caf8b230245480bd, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be350a8c889de5a4ebad378efc8fb4db, type: 3}
      subText: Pick antenna sub assembly from soldering machine and go to next stage
        which is AOI and place it on the jig as highlighted
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be413e3a439e9aa4b9ec5170a8d81894, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 70a8beb2b03dd9c45998be8dad7daf31, type: 3}
      subText: Close the toggle clamp
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 16b49dd582b2d714db76866271c4a894, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: db75843abf6d8e8438d8c63389786b04, type: 3}
      subText: Close the door of AOI
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef4f1804ef5fe974ca35bbd2ebc3a4f6, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d7f763ee63641a4f8e8146bd52c74a2, type: 3}
      subText: 'Click the start button to start the process and Wait for the Result
        on monitor screen '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c763a6034fb4aed40a28c5c8dcb2bd80, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c91a3bb34c1b2a245b7fd384e347e2e2, type: 3}
      subText: 'Open the door of AOI '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a08836d471b60048aeec665fbfcf7d8, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b487eaa9a6765d47b2fe42f7702c5c0, type: 3}
      subText: Open the toggle clamp
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 70aa6d50450fe50448901d8709caa520, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 671a76dd4c112b240beeb6682920ab77, type: 3}
      subText: 'Pick antenna sub assembly from AOI jig and go the next stage which
        is ANT cover assembly and start visual check for any defect under the magnifying
        glass '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd08897dbd055d64f8b08d99d0661cf0, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5af06ff908c5a8346a9f6b09458c823d, type: 3}
      subText: 'Pick antenna cover from tray using right hand '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c825de911093162428b0d6927b2f3c6c, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f6bd6fa5ff2674418890a2ac7b85c30, type: 3}
      subText: Place antenna cover on the antenna sub assembly
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4f0006bdf6433d04b9c2e1af975c634c, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b03677b0e520ad2448960488192b2aa8, type: 3}
      subText: Now place antenna sub assembly on the manual punching machine jig
        as highlighted
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 29c1a052d6f86d74dbc4026e4143fe33, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd293b6e27cf4344da84f21bbdda934f, type: 3}
      subText: After placing antenna sub assembly on jig , now close the toggle clamp
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43ff44ff26d91c5449d78982b384f101, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1006110cd2c58e04aa3f459273183928, type: 3}
      subText: 'Pull the lever to press the antenna cover into the antenna sub assembly '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ebb27621bd51a8c47afcaf5671561e84, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 912a37412bd284b41b05bfcdbaa15ff4, type: 3}
      subText: Open the toggle clamp
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80cbdb0ae2e68a7478cfbbedc22d483b, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 199803005447b6448820568f8a85f04a, type: 3}
      subText: 'Pick antenna sub assembly from manual punching machine and go to
        next stage which is function checker and place it on the jig as highlighted '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdcd29bf62ffdba49aa41149a263c5ba, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c618af32ae82c94a8a4c1211d779d80, type: 3}
      subText: 'Now grab the plug and securely connect it to the highlighted port
        of the antenna sub assembly '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8a36c87f3625404a84e30d1f0a813c4, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03f8aa8bc63749844870033c73764b80, type: 3}
      subText: Close the toggle clamp
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5697f33fbb95837478bcf4d51d2fbc33, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7cafdedd32500f64489e5a901e8166ac, type: 3}
      subText: Close the door of function checker using right hand
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f988a88b5b32ff43a757fd3bcf09033, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b947d14bdcf328148bf3971b04e22e9c, type: 3}
      subText: Click the start button to start the process and Wait for the Result
        on monitor screen
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9ae824b6ba64134ea5c133c3912f209, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d9d5466c36508a349a3901daa55ac2ed, type: 3}
      subText: 'Open the door of function checker using right hand '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 82a22fdb15c1c0443b7f1e66c2a2d70a, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f5a0159a2dc231045ab8950f47d016c8, type: 3}
      subText: 'Open the toggle clamp '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 696c587992229884ba153ee0982885a6, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b90e7b75d258f24b824e1f5b3c88dce, type: 3}
      subText: 'Pick antenna sub assembly from Function checker jig and go the next
        stage which is Label pasting and place it on the jig as highlighted '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 791e41dc260e61442bc4ec97a8c4bd5d, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f162abe3f3a17124c80675adbf6820eb, type: 3}
      subText: Grab label from label printing machine
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: daa4d05c66dd2704cb51564fd9cd48c3, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e99a0469643dc394bbeb6d97d02f3a0a, type: 3}
      subText: Stick label on the antenna sub assembly as highlighted
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 924fcfe1d8998934ebea9ccf9329c16c, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eda8feba4bc193140a458054ac89e56a, type: 3}
      subText: 'Close the flap using left hand '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 87fdd00c67b13b8419a71db102d892da, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dc588bef7199a6b448862ecf574544a9, type: 3}
      subText: Press green button
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 97bf215b479add34582ded7426899065, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 515e73ebea22cc64b839f28f001d190e, type: 3}
      subText: Open the flap using left hand
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3767440cc4ad5044cb170caad773a50a, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72ba2f8b3917b0a4db45588e08cd762e, type: 3}
      subText: 'Grab the marker '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 323d1a3e27ee98847ba206bc5ded41db, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 893ba20440ea8f44e8a519f3b873806f, type: 3}
      subText: 'Make marking on antenna sub assembly as highlighted '
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec78d53b6295b6d41acde51caf2a0174, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 511ee0f6c9414a343aa693e3ba9e812f, type: 3}
      subText: Leave marker on table and pick antenna sub assembly from label pasting
        jig
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6d4ff16e420b604bb0ccccc5271d480, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 217b8c4c3b124d84abed74faf4d17b23, type: 3}
      subText: Now place the antenna sub assembly into the packing box and pack 12
        antenna sub assembly at once in a row
    - _english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d388012e700fd474e89ad9765a1555e6, type: 3}
      _hindi: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39374767347a82242809b698ee48cc60, type: 3}
      subText: Congratulation!
